## Conventions

- Work inside `.venv`: `.venv\Scripts\activate` then `pip install -r requirements.txt`.
- Every module imports paths / feature lists from `src/config.py` — never hard-code.
- Trained artefacts (`models/`, `reports/`) are committed so each phase builds on the
  last without retraining; only `data/raw/` is git-ignored.
- One commit per phase, message prefixed `Phase N:`, pushed to `origin/main`.
- After each phase: update the README status table and add a `Phases/Phase N` report.
